  "description": "Culture, time-zone and translation services for Zonit applications. Provides ICultureState/ICultureManager (per-scope culture and time zone), ICultureProvider (translation rendering), ITranslationManager and its process-wide registry, ILanguageProvider with 17 built-in languages, and the Translation value object. Framework-agnostic: no HttpContext and no middleware here — the ASP.NET culture middleware lives in Zonit.Extensions.Website. Built on the Culture and TimeZone value objects from Zonit.Extensions.",
